---
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-medium mb-4">
        <span>The Foundation Advantage</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Your SaaS Infrastructure, Already Structured.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300">
        Django SaaS Foundation handles the repetitive multi-tenant scaffolding so you can write the code that differentiates your product and drives revenue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Two-Column Side-by-Side Comparison: Handled by Foundation vs Built by You -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left Column: What the Foundation Handles -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-card/80 border border-emerald-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/40 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              READY OUT OF THE BOX
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">apps.common / apps.tenants / apps.subscriptions</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Core Foundation Scaffolding
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">
            Proven architectural patterns implemented cleanly in standard Django and PostgreSQL.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">PostgreSQL Database-Per-Tenant Isolation</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Physical separation eliminates cross-tenant data leakage risks.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Stateless SimpleJWT with Rotation & Blacklist</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Secure token authentication with refresh token revocation on logout.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">4-Tier Strict Role Hierarchy (RBAC)</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Owner, Admin, Member, and Viewer with non-escalatable permissions.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Universal Quota Engine (QuotaRegistry)</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Decoupled counter registry that enforces resource limits per tier.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Transactional Outbox & Tenant-Aware Celery</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Atomic message dispatch with automated tenant context injection.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-border text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400/90 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>0 demo tables required in fresh production migrations</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: What Developers Build -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-card/80 border border-indigo-500/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-950/60 border border-indigo-800/40 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
              WHERE YOU SPEND YOUR TIME
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">apps.&lt;your_product&gt;</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            Your Core Product Differentiation
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">
            Plug your consumer models directly into the tenant routing pipeline with zero friction.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">→</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Domain-Specific Data Models & APIs</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Create your invoices, documents, AI agents, or analytics tables.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">→</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Custom Frontends & Mobile Applications</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Connect Next.js, React, Astro, or Vue via clean REST endpoints and OpenAPI.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">→</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Customer Feature Requests & Feedback</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Ship user-requested features in sprints instead of debugging DB connections.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">→</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Commercial Pricing & Go-To-Market</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Map your custom features to Free, Pro, and Business subscription tiers.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-xs font-bold">→</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Fast Iteration & Time-to-Market</strong>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Launch beta tenants within days of cloning the repository.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-border text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400/90 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Decoupled reference apps (TaskFlow & CRM) demonstrate clean isolation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

